.SH NAME
lean-secret-keygen - Generate ~/.lean/key (mode 0600) for the local secrets backend


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlean secret keygen [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates a random 256-bit master key at ~/.lean/key with permissions 0600.

.PP
This is the recommended way to set up the local backend — no shell export needed.
The directory ~/.lean is created with mode 0700.


